@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>404 - Sayfa Bulunamadı</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, sans-serif;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            background: #222831;
            background-image:
                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(255, 190, 51, .18), transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 85%, rgba(255, 190, 51, .10), transparent 45%);
        }
        .error-box { max-width: 520px; }
        .error-icon {
            width: 84px; height: 84px;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 190, 51, .15);
            color: #ffbe33;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        .error-icon svg { width: 42px; height: 42px; }
        .error-code { font-size: 120px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0; color: #ffbe33; }
        h1 { font-size: 28px; margin: 14px 0 10px; }
        p { color: #aab2bd; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 auto 30px; }
        .actions a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 4px;
            padding: 12px 34px;
            border-radius: 45px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background .2s, color .2s;
        }
        .btn-main { background: #ffbe33; color: #222831; }
        .btn-main:hover { background: #e69c00; }
        .btn-ghost { border: 2px solid #ffbe33; color: #ffbe33; }
        .btn-ghost:hover { background: #ffbe33; color: #222831; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-box">
        <div class="error-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/><path d="M8.5 8.5l5 5M13.5 8.5l-5 5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="error-code">404</div>
        <h1>Sayfa Bulunamadı</h1>
        <p>Aradığınız sayfa taşınmış, silinmiş ya da hiç var olmamış olabilir. Adresi kontrol edip tekrar deneyin.</p>
        <div class="actions">
            <a href="/Main/Index" class="btn-main">Ana Sayfaya Dön</a>
            <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn-ghost">Geri Git</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>